{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫長壽處境喜劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》已畫上句號，令不少忠實劇迷深感不捨。</p><p>藝人「豹哥」單立文日前接受好友雷頌德訪問時透露近況，表示拍畢劇集後正處於休養階段，終於有時間處理先前影響彈結他的手指舊患。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:01:48.548168+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:15:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:58:24.180122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:58:24.180122+00:00","content_hash":"9e40bd0790649b9c6b18e55996d6be05c7f80e4bb83142489317c8bf60efc461","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}